{%- if banned_words %}
{%- set replacements = {} %}
{%- for syn in preferred_synonyms %}
{%- set original = (syn.get("original") or "").strip().lower() %}
{%- set replacement = (syn.get("replacement") or "").strip() %}
{%- if original and replacement %}
{%- set _ = replacements.update({original: replacement}) %}
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}

BANNED WORDS — STRUCTURAL REPLACEMENTS REQUIRED:
{% for word in banned_words %}
{%- set word_lower = word.strip().lower() %}
{%- if word_lower in replacements %}
  ✗ NEVER '{{ word }}' → ✓ ALWAYS use '{{ replacements[word_lower] }}'
{% else %}
  ✗ NEVER '{{ word }}' → ✓ REPHRASE using brand vocabulary
{% endif %}
{%- endfor %}

If you are about to write a banned word — STOP. Use the replacement instead.
Content containing banned words will be automatically rejected and rewritten.
{% endif %}
